# NOTICE

`sgnano_povray` is a port of POV-Ray 3.7 to the sgnano video console.

## Main license

The application code in this repository is distributed under the **GNU Affero
General Public License, version 3 or later** (AGPL-3.0-or-later), because it is
built on POV-Ray 3.7. See `LICENSE`.

Exception: `include/sgx4_api.h` is an early SGX ABI design proposal. It is
licensed under the **MIT License** (`LICENSES/MIT.txt`) so that the sgnano
project can adopt it. It is historical and is not used by the current build;
the authoritative ABI header is the vendored SDK header
`third_party/sgnano/sdk/sgx/include/sgx_api.h`.

